  "body_html": "<p>Espacio para los seguidores que vas reclutando por el camino, y el recordatorio de la hoja sobre qué ha venido a hacer un jugador. Los seguidores tienen un conjunto completo de estadísticas, muy parecidas a las de los monstruos, más un <strong>coste</strong> y <strong>Lealtad</strong> — consulta <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"npcs-followers.html\" data-slug=\"npcs-followers\">PNJ y seguidores</a>. El marcador de HP bajo cada seguidor se comparte con toda la mesa.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-1\" data-label=\"Follower 1\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-1\">Seguidor 1</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiquetas</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"etiquetas\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag0\"> <span><em>excepcional</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag1\"> <span><em>grupo</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP máx.\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP máx.</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armadura\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armadura</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Daño\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Tirar daño\">Daño</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinto</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"hacia …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Movimientos</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Coste</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"qué los mantiene a tu lado\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f1-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lealtad</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lealtad 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lealtad 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lealtad 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Equipo</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notas</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notas\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-2\" data-label=\"Follower 2\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-2\">Seguidor 2</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Nombre</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"nombre\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etiquetas</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"etiquetas\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag0\"> <span><em>excepcional</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag1\"> <span><em>grupo</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"HP máx.\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">HP máx.</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Armadura\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Armadura</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Daño\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Tirar daño\">Daño</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinto</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"hacia …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Movimientos</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"movimiento\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Coste</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"qué los mantiene a tu lado\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f2-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lealtad</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lealtad 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lealtad 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lealtad 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lealtad 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Equipo</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notas</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notas\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"players-agenda\">Agenda del jugador</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Interpreta un personaje fascinante</li><li>Implícate en el mundo de ficción</li><li>Juega para descubrir qué ocurre</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"players-principles\">Principios del jugador</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Empieza y termina con la ficción</li><li>Conecta con los demás PJ</li><li>Muéstranos qué es importante para ti</li><li>Ten metas y persíguelas</li><li>Sé audaz, arriesga</li><li>Abraza la dificultad, el revés y el fracaso</li><li>Participa en construir el mundo</li><li>Construye sobre lo que otros han dicho</li><li>Da a los demás la ocasión de brillar</li><li>Participa en la conversación</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-in-doubt\">En caso de duda…</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Visualiza la situación</li><li>Pide aclaraciones al DJ</li><li>¿Qué quieres? ¿Cuál es tu meta?</li><li>Considera tus puntos fuertes y débiles</li><li>Busca ideas en los demás</li><li>Ve a por la elección obvia, la interesante, la significativa… no siempre la «correcta» (recuerda: ¡ganas XP al fallar!)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"triggering-moves\">Activar movimientos</h2>\n<p>Si quieres hacerlo, hazlo en la ficción. Cuéntanos cómo lo haces, qué aspecto tiene. Sé concreto.</p>\n<p>Pero recuerda: si lo haces en la ficción, lo tienes que hacer. «Paso corriendo junto al hagr para agarrar la espada resplandeciente», y el DJ dice que eso es Desafiar el Peligro con DEX. No pasa nada por decir: «¿Ah, sí? Entonces mejor no lo hago». Pero si quieres pasar corriendo junto al hagr, toca tirar los dados.</p>\n<h2 id=\"hold-and-spend\">Reservas: guardar y gastar</h2>\n<p>Cuando un movimiento dice «guarda X Recurso (hasta que/mientras/siempre que ___)», anota el Recurso que guardas y gástalo como describa el movimiento. Gastar un Recurso guardado suele significar que simplemente lo haces, sin tirada.</p>\n<p>A veces, no obstante, gastar un Recurso guardado te permitirá activar un movimiento (y por tanto tirar) cuando de otro modo no habrías podido.</p>"
}
